{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Budget Tracker 是一套針對收入不固定、來源多元，甚至需要與家人共用財務而設的理財應用，適合自由工作者、創作者、創業者及雙薪家庭使用。它把每月淨收入整理成分配計劃、儲蓄目標與債務還款進度，資料儲存於裝置、無需註冊帳號，並支援語音輸入、收據掃描與桌面小工具。原價 US $1.49，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>薪資分配與目標儲蓄</h2>\n<p>把每月淨收入拆成可執行的分配計劃，按固定金額或比例設定住屋、飲食、儲蓄與債務分類桶，帳單可切換月繳或年繳。儲蓄目標可設定金額、期限與照片，配合進度條與里程碑追蹤；分類預算與週期帳單一鍵標記完成，淨資產與債務還款時間表亦整合其中。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-226-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-227-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-228-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-229-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-230-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-231-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Budget Tracker – VeroSpend</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T05:59:53.106383+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}